# Local DMG reinstall after code changes

After you finish changing QuotaBar app source (`Sources/`, `Package.swift`, `VERSION`, `.swift-version`, or `scripts/build_macos_app.sh`), run:

```bash
scripts/reinstall_local_dmg.sh
```

This rebuilds the app, creates a DMG, replaces `/Applications/QuotaBar.app`, and relaunches QuotaBar.

Do not modify, delete, or rewrite user-level data, including:

- `~/Library/Application Support/QuotaBar/` (accounts, credentials, quota cache, profiles)
- macOS Keychain items
- `~/Library/Preferences/com.local.quotabar.plist`
- `~/.quotabar.json` and `~/.quotabar-credentials.json`

If only docs, tests, or hook/scripts other than `build_macos_app.sh` changed, skip the reinstall. If the stop hook asks you to reinstall, run the script once and stop.
